  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1065496,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Can't ESC ;lt3 - Commodore 64\n\nEscape the clutches of the sinister Mr. Smiley in *1 Can't ESC ;lt3*, a frantic and challenging puzzle-adventure for the Commodore 64! Trapped within a bizarre, ever-shifting mansion, you must navigate a series of increasingly difficult rooms, each presenting unique and perilous puzzles. \n\nThe gameplay blends fast-paced action with brain-teasing challenges. You'll need to quickly analyze your surroundings, collect vital items, and solve intricate riddles to unlock new areas and evade Mr. Smiley’s watchful gaze.  Missteps trigger deadly traps and summon the relentless pursuit of the mansion's unsettling inhabitants. \n\nFeaturing vibrant, pixel-art graphics and a haunting chiptune soundtrack, *1 Can't ESC ;lt3* delivers a tense and atmospheric experience.  Master your reflexes, sharpen your wits, and uncover the secrets of the mansion before it's too late – can you escape?"
    },
